  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Blyth Ph2b) Integrated Humanitarian Response for IDPs affected by the Ukraine Crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuation of Phase 2 Ukraine DEC response. Based on community consultation, Bythwood&apos;s partners will be providing :
- WASH kits
- Nonprescription medicines
- NFIs utility costs and food for IDP centers
- Legal assistance and PSS support for adults
- Childrens&apos; activities
- Cash (MPCA, A&amp;A and sclr)</narrative>
  </description>
